{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41394","headline":"感怀诗二章 二 · 韩熙载","name":"感怀诗二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未到故乡时，将爲故乡好。\n及至亲得归，争如身不到。\n目前相识无一人，出入空伤我怀抱。\n风雨萧萧旅馆秋，归来窗下和衣倒。\n梦中忽到江南路，寻得花边旧居处。\n桃脸蛾眉笑出门，争向前头拥将去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩熙载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}